                                                "sense_id": "e18e4e05-4954-3e09-bcf5-21a3f8541737",
                                                "text": "The problem is that the connection between subprime default rates, on the one hand, and CDO valuations and default rates, on the other, is so complex that it's very difficult to say in a simple sense that a rise in mortgage defaults will lead to a rise in CDO defaults."
                                            },
