                                                "sense_id": "e18e4e05-4954-3e09-bcf5-21a3f8541737",
                                                "text": "These CDOs had been so sliced and diced that it was possible to claim that a tier of the interest payments from the original borrowers was as dependable as a stream of income on a ten-year US Treasury bond, and therefore worthy of a coveted triple-A rating."
